{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-10-11 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE INTRODUCES NEW SIMPLE PLEX AAV VIRAL TITER ASSAYS', 'text': 'SIMPLE PLEX AAV ASSAYS COMBINE INDUSTRY LEADING AAV ANTIBODY REAGENTS FROM PROGEN WITH CONVENIENCE AND SIMPLICITY OF THE FULLY AUTOMATED ELLA PLATFORM. MINNEAPOLIS , OCT. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) AND PROGEN ANNOUNCED TODAY THE RELEASE OF THREE NEW SIMPLE PLEX™ ADENO-ASSOCIATED VIRUS (AAV) VIRAL TITER ASSAYS FOR INTACT AAV CAPSID QUANTIFICATION.'}